        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Securing the foundation: Act Security Launches to Eliminate the Root Cause of Every Breach]]></title>
        <id>https://act.security/resources/securing-the-foundation-act-security-launches-to-eliminate-the-root-cause-of-every-breach</id>
        <link href="https://act.security/resources/securing-the-foundation-act-security-launches-to-eliminate-the-root-cause-of-every-breach"/>
        <updated>2026-07-28T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="resources_card"><div data-animate="slide-in" data-clip-sq="tl tr bl br" class="resources_card-visual-w" style=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a677c3faf3fca7a150090d4_10.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a677c3faf3fca7a150090d4_10-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a677c3faf3fca7a150090d4_10-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a5f29615015defef7c9471f/6a677c3faf3fca7a150090d4_10.avif 810w" class="img_abs is-resources"></div><div class="resources_card-text"><div class="heading-with-p is-16 is-left is-grow"><div class="heading-with-p is-8 is-left"><div class="heading-with-p is-6 is-left"><div data-animate="slide-in" style="background-color: rgb(127, 197, 248); color: rgb(52, 12, 5);" class="resources_tag"><div fs-list-field="category">Blog</div></div><h3 fs-list-field="title" data-animate="slide-in" class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-normal" style="">Securing the foundation: Act Security Launches to Eliminate the Root Cause of Every Breach</h3></div><p fs-list-field="description" data-animate="slide-in" class="text-body text-style-2lines" style="">Every breach eventually comes down to the same root cause: Access. Security has spent a decade obsessed over chasing exposures and racking up findings, while access quietly sprawled out of control underneath. Today, Act Security is exiting stealth with a platform built to secure the cloud at its foundation, eliminating the access paths every attacker, human or AI, depends on.</p></div><div data-animate="slide-in" class="resources_author-w" style=""><div fs-list-field="author" class="text-caption text-color-grey-medium">Hadar Landau</div><div fs-list-field="date" class="text-caption text-color-disabled-grey">July 28, 2026</div></div></div></div><a aria-label="Read more" href="/resources/securing-the-foundation-act-security-launches-to-eliminate-the-root-cause-of-every-breach" class="link_abs w-inline-block"></a></div>]]></content>
    </entry>
